          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149823,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa itu kode asinkron?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kode yang dijalankan selama game terus berjalan</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kode yang hanya dijalankan dalam urutan ketat dari atas ke bawah tanpa menunggu</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kode yang dieksekusi satu baris pada satu waktu dan tidak pernah bisa dijeda</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kode yang dijalankan selama game terus berjalan.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149824,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang paling tepat menggambarkan kode berikut?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Starting game setup&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"score += \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game setup is complete&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Our current score is \" /><text value=\"${score}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;This log prints last&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Kodenya sinkron</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kode ini bersifat asinkron</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kodenya belum cukup untuk menarik kesimpulan</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Kodenya sinkron.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149825,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa itu fungsi callback?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Fungsi yang kita teruskan ke fungsi lain dan panggil nanti (misalnya, setelah musuh muncul)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Fungsi khusus yang hanya dapat digunakan sekali dalam sebuah game</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Fungsi yang hanya berjalan sendiri dan tidak pernah bisa diteruskan</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Fungsi yang kita teruskan ke fungsi lain dan panggil nanti (misalnya, setelah musuh muncul).</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149826,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Teruskan fungsi callback ke metode asinkron <code>setTimeout</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"setTimeout\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"118\" endIndex=\"130\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"callbackFunc\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Spawned an enemy later because we're using asynchronous code.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(callbackFunc, \" /><text value=\"1500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame 1: game loop continues&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Frame 2: player can still move&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>callbackFunc</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149827,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Panggil fungsi callback di dalam <code>sayHello</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"103\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" showLevelIntro = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"levelName, callback\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Entering: \" /><text value=\"${levelName}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  callback();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" startLevel = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level started!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showLevelIntro(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Forest 1&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", startLevel);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>callback()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149828,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang dilakukan metode <code>setTimeout()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Menjalankan callback satu kali setelah jeda (seperti memunculkan power-up setelah 2 detik)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ini menjalankan callback-nya berulang kali pada interval tetap</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Ini membuat timer penundaan yang secara otomatis membatalkan metode lain</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Menjalankan callback satu kali setelah jeda (seperti memunculkan power-up setelah 2 detik).</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149829,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang dilakukan metode <code>clearInterval()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ini menghentikan callback berulang yang dimulai oleh <code>setInterval()</code> (seperti menghentikan timer yang terus berdetak)</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Fungsi ini selalu menerima 3 parameter</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Ini hanya berfungsi jika callback interval mengembalikan true</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ini menghentikan callback berulang yang dimulai oleh <code>setInterval()</code> (seperti menghentikan timer yang terus berdetak).</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 149830,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang terjadi dalam kode berikut?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" callback = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy AI tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" intervalID = setInterval(callback, \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" clearInterval(intervalID);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemy AI ticks were stopped&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Callback berjalan setiap 200 milidetik sampai <code>clearInterval()</code> menghentikannya</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Callback dijalankan sekali setelah penundaan 200 milidetik</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Callback dijalankan setiap 1000 milidetik sampai <code>clearInterval()</code> menghentikannya</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Callback berjalan setiap 200 milidetik sampai <code>clearInterval()</code> menghentikannya.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149831,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Panggil <code>setTimeout()</code> dengan fungsi callback dan penundaan <code>1000</code> milidetik.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2000\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"callback\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"ourCallback\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Power-up spawned!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(ourCallback, \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game is running...&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>setTimeout</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>ourCallback,</code>, <code>1000</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149832,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Panggil metode <code>setInterval()</code> dengan fungsi callback dan jeda <code>200</code> milidetik. Simpan hasilnya ke variabel <code>intervalID</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"settimeout\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"intervalID\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"99\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ourCallback = \" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Game tick&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" intervalID = setInterval(ourCallback, \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"setTimeout(\" /><text value=\"()\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" clearInterval(intervalID);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ticks stopped after 1.2 seconds.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}, \" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>setInterval</code>, diikuti oleh <code>ourCallback</code>, dan terakhir <code>200</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 149833,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Lengkapi kondisi <code>if</code> untuk memastikan promise diselesaikan.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"reject\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"boss\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"288\" endIndex=\"304\" /><option startIndex=\"304\" endIndex=\"312\" /><option startIndex=\"323\" endIndex=\"330\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelData = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"forest\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"enemies\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"powerUps\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": [\" /><text value=\"&quot;health&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;speed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"desert\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"enemies\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"powerUps\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": [\" /><text value=\"&quot;ammo&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;health&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;map&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" },\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"boss\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"enemies\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"powerUps\" class=\"attr\" /><text value=\": []\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"loadForestLevel\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Promise\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"resolve, reject\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (levelData.forest.enemies &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   resolve(\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"&quot;Forest level loaded with enemies. Starting level.&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" });\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" startLoad = loadForestLevel();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(startLoad);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>levelData.forest</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.enemies</code>, dan terakhir <code>resolve</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
